{"content":[{"c":["AZRIEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Family chief in the half-tribe of Manasseh that settled east of the Jordan River. Azriel was taken captive along with others by the king of Assyria (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.23-26","r":"1Chr.5.23-26","rawR":"1Chr.5.23-26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.23-26","value":"1Chr.5.23-26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:23-26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Jeremoth’s father. Jeremoth was an official over Naphtali’s tribe under King David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.27.19","r":"1Chr.27.19","rawR":"1Chr.27.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.27.19","value":"1Chr.27.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 27:19"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Seraiah’s father in the reign of King Jehoiakim. Seraiah was sent by the king to arrest Jeremiah and Baruch for prophesying against the evil ways of Israel and Judah (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.36.26","r":"Jer.36.26","rawR":"Jer.36.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.36.26","value":"Jer.36.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 36:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Azriel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:23-26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.23-26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.23-26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.23-26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 27:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.27.19","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.27.19","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.27.19"},{"anchorText":"Jer 36:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.36.26","rawQueryValue":"Jer.36.26","sourceRefExact":"Jer.36.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"a7223c9ae4e4c8d9599f19bafa75fba6fdc1bf6c9841e790f0a18ed47c2b6f10","sourceItemName":"Azriel","sourceItemOrder":660,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Azriel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Azriel","title":"Azriel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}